WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.120
[...failed to convert the significant
 reduction in crime that is there…]

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:04.340
You murderer!

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:07.440
[...and with no end in sight to this wave of crime.]

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:11.420
Everyone knows you’ve fancied Lucy since forever.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.600
Tom? Come by later, yeah?
Sure.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:16.960
Lucy?

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:23.400
[phone number dial]

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:30.300
You were very lucky.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:31.420
Phone fragments here...

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:33.800
and here missed the temporal lobe, but...

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:35.760
Will there be any side-effects?

00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:39.840
If anything unusual happens, 
I want you to let me know straight away.

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:42.460
[There’s a boy staring at me.]

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:00.720
Never been the victim.

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:02.040
I should’ve done something...

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:04.840
No one's mad at you for not being a hero.

00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:09.480
They were there!

00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:10.600
What’re you talking about?

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:11.540
At Lucy’s!

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:14.700
I KNOW WHAT YOU DID

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:18.420
I’ve heard there was some sort of vigilante or something...

00:01:18.980 --> 00:01:20.240
...who’s trying to take on the gangs.

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:26.180
Got ya.

00:01:31.780 --> 00:01:34.240
You don’t call the devil, then get upset when he turns up.

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:38.080
Where, oh where is Lucy?

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:40.200
I’m gonna bury you both down.

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:43.800
They won’t get away with it.

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:51.700
You're f*cked up!

00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:06.000
You're a special kid, Tom.

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:07.680
The special kid.

00:02:08.140 --> 00:02:11.800
